# Standalone candidate, not an installed drop-in. INF04 does not activate SSH.
Port 22
AddressFamily inet
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PermitEmptyPasswords no
StrictModes yes
AllowUsers ovranto-operator
UsePAM yes
DisableForwarding yes
PermitTunnel no
X11Forwarding no
PermitUserEnvironment no
MaxAuthTries 3
MaxSessions 4
LoginGraceTime 30
LogLevel VERBOSE
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
